ACTION_IF NOT FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~QCHSTAR.BCS~ BEGIN FAIL ~Install Nightmare Candlekeep storage before v33.~ END
ACTION_IF NOT FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~IMOEN2J.DLG~ BEGIN FAIL ~IMOEN2J joined dialogue is missing; cannot restore Imoen.~ END

EXTEND_TOP ~QCHLAR.BCS~  ~CotSC/qc_unicorn_grove/scripts/QC33IMRS.baf~
EXTEND_TOP ~QCHINAR.BCS~ ~CotSC/qc_unicorn_grove/scripts/QC33IMRS.baf~
EXTEND_TOP ~QCHSTAR.BCS~ ~CotSC/qc_unicorn_grove/scripts/QC33IMRS.baf~

